    Theorem as_dir :
      path = dot_path ->
      realizes bsegs (mkCfg msF0 mo0) (t_alt2 (t_die (msg_cannot_open path) (m_fs mo0)) (t_opened_dir path (m_fs mo0))).
    Proof using HCEIL H HH DL LIVE TOP TRD sp0 argv s0 msF0 mo0 regs0 mem0 B tid can Hva PRE RDR a0s path Hargv p0 pp Hp0 Hpp.
      intros Hdot. pose proof SPlo as Hlo. pose proof SPhi as Hhi. pose proof Elo. pose proof aceil_loT as HCL. acb.
